The pattern is "abb".
The words is a list of "abc", "deq", "mee", "aqq", "dkd", and "ccc".
The answers is an empty list of text.
For each word in words.
The last is the last position of word.
The okay is 1.
For every left from 0 to last.
For every right from left plus 1 to last.
The patternleft is the slice of pattern from left to left plus 1.
The patternright is the slice of pattern from right to right plus 1.
The wordleft is the slice of word from left to left plus 1.
The wordright is the slice of word from right to right plus 1.
The patternsame is 0, while the wordsame is 0.
If patternleft matches patternright, set patternsame to 1.
If wordleft matches wordright, set wordsame to 1.
If patternsame is not wordsame, set okay to 0.
If left is last minus 1 and right is last and okay is 1, Place word into answers.

For each answer in answers, show answer.
